+```
+
+Write `D(u)=[u,a]`, `R_i=D^i(r)`, and `B_i=D^i(b)`. The executable Jacobi
+identity
+
+```text
+[u,D(v)] = D([u,v]) - [D(u),v]
+```
+
+telescopes immediately to the explicit witness
+
